"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"A boolean flag to make it possible to disable the strict validation that "
"disallows the use of an updatable entity view type for owned relationships. "
"By default, the use is disallowed i.e. the default value is `true`, but "
"since there might be strange models out there, it is possible to allow this. "
"Valid values for this property are `true` or `false`.\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
